{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏第九卷有二釋中一釋耳也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃說上三故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新四十五\n同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾生心行可數知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國土微塵亦復然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若諸菩薩能為如是觀行相應，於諸法中不生二解，一切佛法疾得現前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即得阿耨菩提"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即心自性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "成就慧身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上下卷文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此標文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《孔目》第四文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一一上下文具如初文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略疏\n初二同願心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同修事理也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正念能治故、清淨所治故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後二同得究竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏十八文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十七文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《五教》文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《五教》文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏二十文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四根本、初未至、中間禪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雖位心同，明時義位心既已開合不同，明此差別，故別釋也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今此《孔目》所說見修，約菩薩說也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正諦智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後得智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此五停心觀可作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上唯約始教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記云：約《十地論》、《起信論》意釋。謂《起信論》云「依色自在地故成十身相作義」。\n《十地論》云「三世間自在故得十自在」。約此位故，此位初成佛也。如是第八地中證無生忍，故成法身也。第九地中四\n十九無礙辨才應機說法，故成應身也。第十地中雲雨法說，故成化身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如上門也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寫本云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "露命二九歲，夏䔽一九歲"}
